post.description:
GraphQL endpoint for IAM.

It supports queries on `Person` as defined in the GraphQL Schema under Documentation.

Examples:

Single Data Source:
      {
          "query": "{ people(limit: 10) { iam_id displayname email { primary } } }"
      }

Multiple Data Sources:
      {
      "query": "{ 
          people( limit: 1 affiliationContains: \"student\" ) 
          { 
              iam_id        
              name {lived_first_name lived_last_name}
              id {login_id}
              email {primary}
              phone {primary}
              student_association {college major academic_level class_level}
          }
          colleges
          {
              college_code
              college_title
          }
          majors
          {
              major_title
              major_code
          }
          }"
      }
